<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover">
  <title>Password changed · FormNest</title>
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #F0F4FA 0%, #E9EEF5 100%);
      font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.5;
      padding: 2rem 1rem;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }
    .card {
      max-width: 600px;
      width: 100%;
      background: #fff;
      border-radius: 2rem;
      box-shadow: 0 25px 45px -12px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
      overflow: hidden;
      animation: fadeSlide 0.4s ease forwards;
    }
    .card-inner { padding: 2.5rem 2rem; }
    .brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
      padding-bottom: 12px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #EDF2F7;
    }
    .logo {
      background: #4F46E5;
      width: 46px;
      height: 46px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      border-radius: 1.25rem;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 14px -8px rgba(79,70,229,0.3);
    }
    .logo svg { width: 24px; height: 24px; color: white; }
    .brand-text h2 { font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; background: linear-gradient(135deg,#1E293B,#2D3A5E); background-clip: text; -webkit-background-clip: text; color: transparent; }
    .brand-text p { font-size: 0.7rem; color: #5B6E8C; }
    .greeting { font-size: 1.75rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0A0F1C; margin: 0.5rem 0 0.25rem; }
    .alert-badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      background: #FEF2F2;
      padding: 6px 14px;
      border-radius: 40px;
      margin: 1rem 0 0.75rem;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #B91C1C;
    }
    .message-box {
      background: #F9FBFE;
      border-radius: 1.25rem;
      padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
      border-left: 5px solid #4F46E5;
      margin: 1rem 0 1rem;
      color: #1E293B;
    }
    .security-note {
      background: #FFFBEB;
      border-radius: 1rem;
      padding: 0.9rem 1rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      margin: 1.5rem 0;
      border: 1px solid #FDE68A;
    }
    .support-btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      background: #1E293B;
      color: white;
      padding: 0.7rem 1.5rem;
      border-radius: 40px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-top: 0.5rem;
      transition: 0.2s;
    }
    .support-btn:hover { background: #0F172A; transform: translateY(-1px); }
    .footer-note { text-align: center; font-size: 0.73rem; color: #6C7A92; margin-top: 2rem; border-top: 1px solid #EDF2F7; padding-top: 1.5rem; }
    @media (max-width: 560px) {
      .card-inner { padding: 1.75rem 1.25rem; }
      .greeting { font-size: 1.5rem; }
      .support-btn { width: 100%; justify-content: center; }
    }
    @keyframes fadeSlide { 0% { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); } 100% { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="card">
  <div class="card-inner">
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="logo">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 9h6m-6 4h6m-6 4h6M9 12h.01M5 12h.01M12 12h.01M12 16h.01M12 8h.01M4 20h16a2 2 0 002-2V6a2 2 0 00-2-2H4a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z" />
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="brand-text"><h2>FormNest</h2><p>secure · trusted</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="greeting">Hi {{name}},</div>
    <div class="alert-badge"><span>🔐</span> PASSWORD UPDATED</div>
    <div class="message-box">
      Your FormNest password was just changed. As a security measure, <strong>all active sessions have been signed out</strong> across all devices.
    </div>
    <div class="security-note">
      <span>⚠️</span>
      <div><strong>Didn't make this change?</strong><br>Please contact our support team immediately to secure your account.</div>
    </div>
    <a href="mailto:support@formnest.com?subject=Unauthorized%20password%20change" class="support-btn">
      <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M21 12a9 9 0 01-9 9m9-9a9 9 0 00-9-9m9 9H3m9 9a9 9 0 01-9-9m9 9c1.66 0 3-4 3-9s-1.34-9-3-9m0 18c-1.66 0-3-4-3-9s1.34-9 3-9"/></svg>
      Contact Support
    </a>
    <div class="footer-note">
      🔒 If you changed your password, you can safely ignore this notification.<br>
      © 2025 FormNest — protecting your data
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>